-- The first-run screen (phase 22, ROADMAP 22.4, ADR-0005 §5): what a phone without the game's data shows before
-- anything else, drawn with app.vdpk alone (app/FirstRunScreens, FirstRunWindows): pairing with VanillaDroid Setup on
-- the PC (the QR code's link, or an address and a code), the download, and the ADB way (its steps are setup.lang's
-- VD_SETUP_ADB_GUIDE). English, VanillaDroid's own texts only. Syntax and rules: see common.lang.

-- Home
VD_PAIR_INTRO = "This phone does not have the game's data yet. VanillaDroid Setup makes it on your PC from your own World of Warcraft 1.12.1, and the phone copies it from there (about 4.5 GB).\n\nOpen VanillaDroid Setup on the PC, then choose how the data comes:";
VD_PAIR_OPTION_QR = "Pair with the PC";
